WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:05.964
-Ready, guys?
-Right!

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:10.885
Even if we should fall
in the heat of battle,

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:15.390
our deaths are certain to redouble
our brothers' resolve to carry on,

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:21.521
till the day of victory dawns!

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:27.444
Our raccoon balls swing in the wind

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:32.198
Back and forth, back and forth

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:36.494
Amen

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.662
Special ops! Move aside!

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.497
Gonta, wait!

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:40.915
Move out!

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:59.434
Gonta.

